one-operand padded sum, kernel not captured: the window kernel k has no size in einsum spec "s, 2*o=+1+k => s, o": no operand axis sizes it, and a padded (=+) window's extents do not determine it. Capture the kernel label and set it (x ++ "s, 2*o=+k => s, o" ["k"], then Shape.set_dim k 3), or give the window a kernel operand of known extent (x +* "s, 2*o=+k; k => s, o" w)
